  "emitter_reason": "Euler.dispatch delegates to module implementations, retaining Euler core as address(this). Proxy.sol routes user calls to the creator/core. Token Transfer/Approval may be emitted via proxy separately.",
  "excluded_scope": [
    "underlying ERC20 Transfer/Approval logs emitted by token contracts",
    "eToken/dToken proxy ERC20 events",
    "internal calls and failed/reverted transactions without retained logs",
    "standalone module implementation address logs"
  ],
  "semantic_cautions": [
    "Withdraw emitted by core covers internal balance decreases, eToken transfers and donateToReserves; it is not synonymous with external token withdrawal.",
    "EToken.donateToReserves emits RequestDonate and Withdraw, updates reserve balance and emits AssetStatus; its amount is an internal eToken balance quantity.",
    "Underlying ERC20 outflow requires complete receipt logs and Transfer(from=Euler core), token metadata/decimals and clear treatment of nonstandard tokens.",
    "RequestDonate plus Liquidation in a receipt is an observational sequence, not proof of an omitted health check or of preventable loss."
  ],
